      (city) => `Ready to ditch the tub nobody uses? Our ${city} tub-to-shower conversion team removes your old bathtub and builds a custom walk-in shower in its place. Complete plumbing rework, waterproofing, tile, glass, and fixtures — typically done in 3-5 days.`,
      (city) => `Tub-to-shower conversions are the most popular bathroom upgrade in ${city} right now. We handle everything: tub removal, plumbing modifications, waterproof membrane, backer board, custom tile, glass enclosure, and new fixtures. One crew, one project, one warranty.`,
