      (city) => `Converting a tub to a shower in ${city} is one of the highest-impact bathroom upgrades you can make. We remove the existing tub, rework the plumbing from tub to shower configuration, install proper waterproofing, tile everything, add a glass enclosure, and connect new fixtures. Most projects are completed in 3-5 working days.`,
