        { q: 'Will removing the tub hurt my home value?', a: (city) => `In ${city}, the general rule is to keep at least one bathtub in the home (usually in the main or kids' bathroom). Converting a second or third bathroom tub to a shower almost always increases value. We help you decide which tub to keep.` },
