  (city, service) => `The team found asbestos tile under our vinyl during the ${service.toLowerCase()} demo in our ${city} home. They handled the abatement properly and didn't rush through it. That's the kind of professionalism you need.`,
  (city, service) => `We have a 1970s split-level in ${city} and the ${service.toLowerCase()} presented some real challenges with the existing plumbing. They figured out creative solutions and the result is beautiful.`,
  (city, service) => `After getting quotes from 5 different contractors in ${city}, these guys were the most detailed in their proposal. They actually measured everything twice and the final price matched the estimate exactly.`,
