  (city, service) => `The old galvanized pipes in our ${city} house were a mess. They replaced everything with PEX during the ${service.toLowerCase()} and now our water pressure is incredible. Two problems fixed with one project.`,
  (city, service) => `We had ugly pink tile from the 1950s throughout our ${city} bathroom. The new subway tile with gray grout looks absolutely stunning \u2014 modern but timeless. Friends can't believe it's the same room.`,
  (city, service) => `Went with custom quartz countertops during our ${service.toLowerCase()} in ${city}. The fabrication was perfect \u2014 seams are practically invisible. The installers were meticulous about getting everything level.`,
