  (city, service) => `Living through a renovation is tough, but these guys minimized the disruption at our ${city} home. They set up dust barriers, cleaned daily, and always told us what to expect the next day.`,
  (city, service) => `The heated tile floor they installed during our ${service.toLowerCase()} was the best upgrade decision we made. Washington winters are cold and stepping onto warm tile in ${city} makes every morning better.`,
  (city, service) => `Our builder-grade bathroom in ${city} was embarrassing for a home this nice. After the ${service.toLowerCase()}, guests actually comment on how beautiful the bathroom is. Money well spent.`,
